{
  "name": "Expand your best customers into lookalike accounts with LeadMagic",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lookalike account expansion\n\n### How it works\n1. List your best customers' domains in **Seed customers**.\n2. Find Lookalikes returns similar companies for each seed, with a similarity score.\n3. Duplicates across seeds and weak matches are removed.\n4. New accounts are appended to a Google Sheet for review.\n\n### Setup\n1. Edit **Seed customers** (one domain per line).\n2. Paste a sheet URL into **Save accounts**.\n3. Select your LeadMagic and Google Sheets credentials.\n\n### Customization\nTighten **Strong matches only** to raise the similarity bar, or add HQ country and headcount in Company Filters. Each lookalike call costs 5 credits when it returns results and nothing when it returns none.\n\nRequires the [LeadMagic community node](https://github.com/LeadMagic/leadmagic-n8n#install) (`n8n-nodes-leadmagic`). Tested with n8n 2.47 and n8n-nodes-leadmagic 1.7.0.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "ddd93bbc-1223-54a1-a1c8-54281cfb7f2e",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2cb9db52-8b61-5ff4-842d-2af7103ae65f",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"seeds\": [\"example.com\", \"example.org\"],\n  \"min_similarity\": 0.6\n}\n",
        "options": {}
      },
